 program with his body under complete remote control of the imperious General (Tony Denison). With the aid of a rogue operative Alexandra (Lyndsy Fonseca), David has to retake charge of own actions and fight his way through the top security facility inside the most complex live-action VR film ever made.", "short_description": "In this immersive 360 degree first-person POV VR film, the viewer is dropped into a visceral, action-packed 3D cinematic experience usually seen in movie theaters, only this time YOU are the action hero."}]}, "developer_name": "Serein", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.dropbox.com/s/2anhtcnj3fhtwnl/AE%20Privacy%20Policy.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Agent Emerson", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.agentemerson.com/index.html", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "MOVIE", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "235269428803487"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031350_2478178665729635_8186378043233665024_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eVS4KLXkZV0Q7kNvwGMC8C_&_nc_oc=AdpayJ2hY4WtpmcktIepSs6H41sqzT5H04TxdUzT47J8axxAUwH1lB_5Nmqb8gjQIuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1Wx8Pa-lKH22pDyhoJZXLnR-6MCAfyklfO0W_XPCjFqQ&oe=69F0AEE2"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Agent Emerson", "plat